{
  "batch": "081",
  "how_to": "Translate each value of `items` to Thai following references/translation-rules.md. Write done_081.json with the SAME keys: {\"items\": {key: thai}}. List values stay lists.",
  "items": {
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.4.title": "The Sea of Souls",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.4.desc": "A new reincarnation scene: draw your wishes above a lake of souls under the stars.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.5.title": "Skill fusion",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.5.desc": "When skills merge into a Unique or an Ultimate, they slam into your screen as anime skill cards, the screen shatters, and the shards come back together as the new skill.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.6.title": "Naming, as a cutscene",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.6.desc": "Name a monster and the camera pulls to the side: your magicules flow into it and it lights up as it absorbs them. Then the Sage reports the name, and the Voice of the World confirms its evolution. Players who get named see it from their side. Turn it off with namingScene in the client config.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.7.title": "Thought Acceleration (H)",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.7.desc": "With the Great Sage or Thought Acceleration, press H or say it: the world freezes into cold colors, sounds drag down, your heartbeat takes over and incoming projectiles show their path, red if it hits you. Solo: the whole world slows x5. Multiplayer: a 20-block bubble slows creatures and projectiles. 6 s, 40 s cooldown, both configurable.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.8.title": "Magic Sense (N)",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.8.desc": "With a sense skill such as Magic Sense, see the aura of every being, shaped like its body. Its color follows its alignment (violet Majin, white-gold Hero, red Chaos, green neutral), its size follows its EP and keeps growing: a massive aura in the distance means run. Tune it in Settings.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.9.title": "Growth comes faster",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.9.desc": "Experience gains x1.5, the first kill of a species counts as observing it, and items you hold for the first time are appraised.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.10.title": "Periodic analysis and skill modes",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.10.desc": "With TNO compatibility, analysis grants mastery periodically and no longer fills mode learning points. FoxAblaze Ultimate Raphael also counts as Great Sage.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.11.title": "Gamerules, clearer",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.11.desc": "needGreatSage is now announcementsRequireGreatSage: it only decides who gets the announcements. New: requireGreatSage (on by default). Turn it off and everyone can use the G menu, assess, voice commands and analyses without the Great Sage skill.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.12.title": "Clearer menus",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.12.desc": "Bigger buttons, the Sage's bubble no longer covers the pages, and a sealed class tells you to open it in the Growth tree.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.13.title": "Fixes",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.whatsnew.0_0_7.13.desc": "Reincarnation no longer hands out special addon Uniques, and addon resistances are no longer always Nuclear or Void. Assess bubbles no longer drift when flying, auras no longer get stuck in a capsule shape with some mods, and the freeze before animations is gone. Server admins get /greatsage xp. Voice commands now work with microphones that refuse 16 kHz, and the menu's background hum is much quieter. The Portuguese and Turkish voice models install properly, menu text no longer shows through confirmation windows, a full reset now gives every Unique Tensura owes you from the reset counter, and you no longer stay invulnerable after a rare reincarnation outcome.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.thought.title": "Thought Acceleration",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.thought.unable": "Thought Acceleration needs the Great Sage (or Tensura's Thought Acceleration).",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.thought.cooldown": "Thought Acceleration is recharging: %s s.",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.naming.title": "Naming",
    "lang|greatsage|greatsage.naming.evolved_form": "Evolved %s",
    "lang|iceandfire|block.iceandfire.graveyard_soil.desc": "Spawns Ghosts at night",
