    "lang|iceandfire|iceandfire.ponder.dragon_forge.text_3": "You need the correct type of dragons to power the forge",
    "lang|iceandfire|iceandfire.ponder.dragon_forge.text_4": "You can open the forge by clicking blocks at the center of each face",
